19\t    \"preflight\": \"\",\n   220\t    \"contract\": \"\"\n   221\t  },\n   222\t  \"fixture_results\": [],\n   223\t  \"preflight_results\": [],\n   224\t  \"cost\": {\n   225\t    \"model_calls\": 0,\n   226\t    \"endpoint_calls\": 0\n   227\t  },\n   228\t  \"unverified_items\": [],\n   229\t  \"deviations\": []\n   230\t}\n   231\t```\n   232\t\n   233\t## 5. Exact commands\n   234\t\n   235\tThe implementation must not run a model, endpoint, service, database, training command, network command, loop verifier, commit, or push.\n   236\t\n   237\tAfter this contract is written, hash it before creating or running implementation files:\n   238\t\n   239\t```bash\n   240\tcd /home/testuser/wzh/projects/agents_final_tech\n   241\tsha256sum research/tatqa_wp0_2026/wp1/implementation_contract.md > research/tatqa_wp0_2026/wp1/implementation_contract.sha256\n   242\tsha256sum -c research/tatqa_wp0_2026/wp1/implementation_contract.sha256\n   243\t```\n   244\t\n   245\tImplementation and validation:\n   246\t\n   247\t```bash\n   248\tcd /home/testuser/wzh/projects/agents_final_tech\n   249\tpython3 -m py_compile research/tatqa_wp0_2026/wp1/checker.py research/tatqa_wp0_2026/wp1/adapter.py research/tatqa_wp0_2026/wp1/provenance.py research/tatqa_wp0_2026/wp1/run_fixtures.py\n   250\tpython3 research/tatqa_wp0_2026/wp1/run_fixtures.py\n   251\tpython3 -m json.tool research/tatqa_wp0_2026/wp1/PREFLIGHT_RECEIPT.json >/dev/null\n   252\tpython3 -m json.tool data/research/tatqa_wp0_2026/wp1/FIXTURE_RECEIPT.json >/dev/null\n   253\tpython3 -m json.tool research/tatqa_wp0_2026/wp1/WP1_RECEIPT.json >/dev/null\n   254\t```\n   255\t\n   256\tFinal artifact verification:\n   257\t\n   258\t```bash\n   259\tcd /home/testuser/wzh/projects/agents_final_tech\n   260\tsha256sum research/tatqa_wp0_2026/wp1/checker.py research/tatqa_wp0_2026/wp1/adapter.py research/tatqa_wp0_2026/wp1/fixtures/synthetic_fixtures.json research/tatqa_wp0_2026/wp1/PREFLIGHT_RECEIPT.json research/tatqa_wp0_2026/wp1/implementation_contract.md\n   261\tgit status --short -- research/tatqa_wp0_2026/wp1 data/research/tatqa_wp0_2026/wp1\n   262\t```\n   263\t\n   264\t## 6. Stop conditions\n   265\t\n   266\t- Pinned input hash mismatch: report `HASH_MISMATCH` and stop.\n   267\t- Any of the six fixture obligations fails: report `SOFTWARE_NOT_QUALIFIED` with the failed obligation and stop without changing the fixture to force a pass.\n   268\t- Any required forbidden action: stop and report the blocked requirement.\n   269\t- No scientific result, pilot result, candidate-item score, or held-out outcome is permitted in any receipt.\n   270\t\n   271\t## 7. Revision 1.1 completion addendum (2026-10-13)\n   272\t\n   273\tRun 1 (`tatqa-wp1-20261013`) failed closed on `hidden_gold_search` because the original check searched the actor-visible raw cells `late_value` and `early_value`. Revision 1.1 of the governing contract supersedes only that obligation.\n   274\t\n   275\tThe run-2 implementation of `hidden_gold_search`:\n   276\t\n   277\t- retains the exact forbidden-name search from run 1;\n   278\t- searches only the checker-rendered `delta_source` and `delta_target` strings;\n   279\t- applies boundary-aware matching to the full serialized actor-visible projection for every fixture, requiring zero matches and applying no length filter;\n   280\t- excludes `late_value` and `early_value` from the answer-value search set;\n   281\t- requires the same boundary-aware search to return zero matches over raw table cells and period labels alone for every fixture, so the search is non-vacuous.\n   282\t\n   283\tThe seven synthetic fixture numbers require no adjustment because all seven satisfy the fixture-design precondition. No checker, adapter, provenance module, pinned input, or scientific item was changed.\n   284\t\n   285\tRun 2 uses run id `tatqa-wp1b-20261013`. On a passing run it emits these artifacts:\n   286\t\n   287\t- `research/tatqa_wp0_2026/wp1/PREFLIGHT_RECEIPT.json`\n   288\t- `data/research/tatqa_wp0_2026/wp1/FIXTURE_RECEIPT.json`\n   289\t- `research/tatqa_wp0_2026/wp1/WP1_RECEIPT.json`\n   290\t\n   291\tThe generated receipts carry zero model and endpoint calls, per-obligation results, the requested artifact hashes, unverified items, and deviations. This addendum does not change any other obligation or stop condition.\n","exit_code":0,"status":"completed"}}
