 `{pins['adapter']}`\n  1045\t- Synthetic fixtures: `{pins['fixtures']}`\n  1046\t- Preflight receipt: `{pins['preflight']}`\n  1047\t- Implementation contract: `{pins['contract']}`\n  1048\t\n  1049\t## 3. Actor freeze\n  1050\t\n  1051\t- Actor revision: `PENDING`\n  1052\t- Model identity: `PENDING`\n  1053\t- Model settings: `PENDING`\n  1054\t- Calculator/tool implementation hash: `PENDING`\n  1055\t- Adapter settings: `PENDING`\n  1056\t\n  1057\t## 4. Experience context\n  1058\t\n  1059\t- Episode-source contract: `PENDING`\n  1060\t- Real E blocks: `PENDING`\n  1061\t- Real C blocks: `PENDING`\n  1062\t- Origin-disjointness receipt: `PENDING`\n  1063\t- Near-duplicate isolation receipt: `PENDING`\n  1064\t- E/C token-delta receipt: `PENDING`\n  1065\t- S rules: `PENDING`\n  1066\t\n  1067\t## 5. Evaluation and analysis\n  1068\t\n  1069\t- Frozen item/split receipt: `PENDING`\n  1070\t- Pilot task list: `PENDING`\n  1071\t- Repeat count and ordering: `PENDING`\n  1072\t- Analysis script hash: `PENDING`\n  1073\t- Bootstrap method and seed: `PENDING`\n  1074\t- Origin-level difference table: `PENDING`\n  1075\t\n  1076\t## 6. Budget, window, and governance\n  1077\t\n  1078\t- Owner authorization: `PENDING`\n  1079\t- Advisor authorization: `PENDING`\n  1080\t- Budget/window binding: `PENDING`\n  1081\t- Start/end UTC: `PENDING`\n  1082\t- Model-call budget: `PENDING`\n  1083\t- Endpoint-call budget: `PENDING`\n  1084\t- Judge-call budget: `0`\n  1085\t\n  1086\t## 7. Stop rules\n  1087\t\n  1088\t- Leakage or bridge failure: `STOP_THIS_PANEL`\n  1089\t- B ceiling on both repeats: `STOP_THIS_PANEL`\n  1090\t- Any unauthorized model, judge, endpoint, database, or service call: stop and report.\n  1091\t- Fixture or checker failure: report `SOFTWARE_NOT_QUALIFIED`; never weaken the failing test.\n  1092\t\"\"\"\n  1093\t    PREREG_PATH.write_text(text, encoding=\"utf-8\", newline=\"\\n\")\n  1094\t\n  1095\t\n  1096\tdef write_outputs(\n  1097\t    fixtures: Mapping[str, Any],\n  1098\t    obligations: list[dict[str, Any]],\n  1099\t    metrics: Mapping[str, Any],\n  1100\t) -> None:\n  1101\t    preflight = _preflight_checks(fixtures)\n  1102\t    preflight[\"run_id\"] = RUN_ID\n  1103\t    provenance.write_json_lf(PREFLIGHT_PATH, preflight)\n  1104\t    artifact_hashes = {\n  1105\t        \"checker\": sha256_file(WORK_DIR / \"checker.py\"),\n  1106\t        \"adapter\": sha256_file(WORK_DIR / \"adapter.py\"),\n  1107\t        \"provenance\": sha256_file(WORK_DIR / \"provenance.py\"),\n  1108\t        \"run_fixtures\": sha256_file(WORK_DIR / \"run_fixtures.py\"),\n  1109\t        \"fixtures\": sha256_file(FIXTURE_PATH),\n  1110\t        \"contract\": sha256_file(WORK_DIR / \"implementation_contract.md\"),\n  1111\t        \"preflight\": sha256_file(PREFLIGHT_PATH),\n  1112\t    }\n  1113\t    fixture_payload = provenance.attributed_payload(\n  1114\t        {\n  1115\t            \"schema\": \"tatqa_wp1_fixture_receipt_v1\",\n  1116\t            \"run_id\": RUN_ID,\n  1117\t            \"task\": \"tatqa_wp1_loop_a\",\n  1118\t            \"status\": (\n  1119\t                \"PASS\"\n  1120\t                if all(row[\"status\"] == \"PASS\" for row in obligations)\n  1121\t                and all(\n  1122\t                    row[\"status\"] == \"PASS\"\n  1123\t                    for row in metrics[\"additional_checks\"]\n  1124\t                )\n  1125\t                and metrics[\"metric_pipeline\"][\"status\"] == \"PASS\"\n  1126\t                else \"FAIL\"\n  1127\t            ),\n  1128\t            \"fixture_source\": str(FIXTURE_PATH.relative_to(REPO_ROOT)),\n  1129\t            \"artifact_hashes\": artifact_hashes,\n  1130\t            \"obligations\": obligations,\n  1131\t            \"taxonomy_checks\": next(\n  1132\t                row\n  1133\t                for row in metrics[\"additional_checks\"]\n  1134\t                if row[\"id\"] == \"outcome_taxonomy\"\n  1135\t            ),\n  1136